    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(10th Level)</em></p><p>You bless a site or community for a day.</p><p>Choose one infrastructure blessing:</p><ul><li><p>Food supply stabilizes.</p></li><li><p>Shelter becomes secure.</p></li><li><p>Calm spreads.</p></li><li><p>Structures repair.</p></li><li><p>Safe passage becomes reliable.</p></li></ul><p>This is not combat power.<br />This is sustainability.</p><h3>Cost</h3><p>Spend 1–2 Surge (scale by scope).</p><h3>Scope</h3><p>Blessings operate narratively within reason; they do not invalidate natural law.</p><h3>Pushback</h3><p>Communities may begin expecting miracles instead of building systems.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
